  "statement": "You are given a number of courses labeled from 0 to numCourses - 1 and a list of prerequisite pairs. Each pair [a, b] indicates that you must take course b before you can take course a.\n\nDetermine if it is possible to finish all courses. Return true if you can finish all courses, and false otherwise.",
